WEBVTT

00:10:29.041 --> 00:10:31.418
and coordinate in a fairer way

00:10:31.418 --> 00:10:34.546
on larger-scale problems than ever before.

00:10:35.339 --> 00:10:39.385
And maybe a DAO can even build
the next great city.

00:10:39.927 --> 00:10:41.095
Thank you.

00:10:41.095 --> 00:10:45.391
(Applause)